# === OS ===
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

.vercel
.env*
# ...but the template is the one env file that must be committed: it is the only place a new
# clone learns which keys exist. `.env*` was swallowing it, so the repo had no env template at
# all and every key had to be discovered from source.
!.env.example

# Downloaded source files for scripts/gen-*.py — re-fetchable, never committed
.cache/
